1
00:02:41,161 --> 00:02:42,539
The scenes you are watching

2
00:02:42,563 --> 00:02:45,875
are from the highly-rated
action-adventure shows<i> Mustang,</i>

3
00:02:45,899 --> 00:02:48,211
<i>Chopper Squad</i> and<i> Highway Guys.</i>

4
00:02:48,235 --> 00:02:50,379
But now, in the
"life imitates art"

5
00:02:50,403 --> 00:02:53,450
and "truth is stranger
than fiction" categories,

6
00:02:53,474 --> 00:02:57,187
the producer of these
exciting shows, Paul J. Bartel,

7
00:02:57,211 --> 00:02:59,155
stands trial for the
murder of the man

8
00:02:59,179 --> 00:03:00,690
whose network they're on.

9
00:03:00,714 --> 00:03:04,027
This man, Greg Titleman,
network programming chief,

10
00:03:04,051 --> 00:03:05,327
who was found
stabbed in the back

11
00:03:05,351 --> 00:03:07,631
at this exclusive Bedford hotel.

12
00:03:07,655 --> 00:03:10,233
Hello, everybody.
I'm Terry McNeil.

13
00:03:10,257 --> 00:03:11,300
And I'm Doug August,

14
00:03:11,324 --> 00:03:13,470
welcoming you to<i>
Hollywood Today,</i>

15
00:03:13,494 --> 00:03:15,705
where this evening's
entire hour will be devoted

16
00:03:15,729 --> 00:03:18,174
to an event that has shaken
the Hollywood community

17
00:03:18,198 --> 00:03:20,209
like no other before it.

18
00:03:20,233 --> 00:03:23,212
Greg wasn't the cold-hearted,
impersonal executive

19
00:03:23,236 --> 00:03:24,714
everyone thought him to be.

20
00:03:24,738 --> 00:03:27,984
You know, the kind who
did everything on the phone.

21
00:03:28,008 --> 00:03:31,788
To the contrary, he thrived
on the personal touch.

22
00:03:31,812 --> 00:03:34,023
For instance, when he
canceled my first series,

23
00:03:34,047 --> 00:03:37,794
he personally told his
assistant to call me.

24
00:03:37,818 --> 00:03:43,733
An actress remembers that
kind of thoughtfulness, believe me.

25
00:03:43,757 --> 00:03:45,701
Before Greg took over the
network a few years ago,

26
00:03:45,725 --> 00:03:48,705
