each other in the front.

28
00:03:53,467 --> 00:03:56,679
Well, he changed that
all around, didn't he?

29
00:03:56,703 --> 00:03:58,748
And now, after weeks of
evidence and argument,

30
00:03:58,772 --> 00:04:01,451
the case of the People versus
Greg's accused murderer,

31
00:04:01,475 --> 00:04:04,187
Paul J. Bartel, has
gone to the jury.

32
00:04:04,211 --> 00:04:08,024
Why don't we tell our viewers
how and where it all began?

33
00:04:08,048 --> 00:04:10,326
Greg Titleman came
into Los Angeles

34
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:12,696
the first weekend in
April for some meetings

35
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,363
