61
00:06:15,942 --> 00:06:16,920
What about?

62
00:06:16,944 --> 00:06:19,722
Business.

63
00:06:19,746 --> 00:06:21,724
Two of you were friends?

64
00:06:21,748 --> 00:06:23,559
Absolutely. We've known
each other for years.

65
00:06:23,583 --> 00:06:24,916
